## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- A C++ compiler such as `g++` or `clang++` (C++11 or later)

### Build

```bash
git clone https://github.com/syampullamar/Object-Oriented-Stack-Design-Using-C-Templates.git
cd Object-Oriented-Stack-Design-Using-C-Templates
g++ -Wall -Wextra -std=c++11 "main (2).cpp" -o stack
```

### Run

```bash
./stack
```

On Windows, run `stack.exe` instead.

