## 🧪 Example Session

```
select one option
1)int stack 2)char stack 3)float stack 4)double stack 5)string stack 6)exit
1
enter 1 for new stack 2)previous stack
1
select one option
1)push 2)pop 3)display stack 4)exit
1
enter int to push
10
1
enter int to push
20
3
10 20
2
3
10
2
2
stack underflow
4
```

**Messages you may see**

| Message | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `stack overflow` | You tried to push onto a full stack (5 elements) |
| `stack underflow` | You tried to pop from an empty stack |
| `stack is empty` | You tried to display an empty stack |
| `enter valid option` | The menu choice wasn't recognised |

