## 🗺️ Roadmap

- [ ] Make the capacity a template parameter (`template<class T, int N>`)
- [ ] Add `peek()`, `isEmpty()` and `isFull()`
- [ ] Return the popped value instead of only removing it
- [ ] Validate non-numeric input at the menus
- [ ] Merge the five per-type handlers into one function template
- [ ] Move the class into `stack.h` and keep `main.cpp` for the driver

